  "bodyHash": "xpFyzZZ6YcM=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#daa520\">从3.0.0版本开始，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsemos-animations-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Semos动画库</span></a>变为可选组件。</span></p><blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>未使用动画库时的效果：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>武器会根据类型被持握在自定义位置</li>\n<li>实体会时不时眨眼</li>\n<li>实体在水中会有简单的游泳动画</li>\n<li>快速移动时实体会前倾（1.22+版本）</li>\n<li>实体可坐进船中（理论上也适用于其他生物）</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote><blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>使用动画库后的效果：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>武器会持握在自定义位置，并根据武器类型拥有不同的攻击动画</li>\n<li>实体会眨眼并有精细的眼部运动</li>\n<li>精细的游泳动画</li>\n<li>行走时带有\"颠簸\"动画，会环顾四周，快速移动时前倾（1.22+版本）</li>\n<li>待机动画模拟呼吸效果</li>\n<li>实体可坐进船中（理论上也适用于其他生物）</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote><p>注意：部分实体因技术限制有不同表现。例如，寒冰掠夺者不会眨眼，武器也不在自定义位置持握。</p><div>&nbsp;</div><div>### 本资源包旨在为模组提供[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fresh Animations</strong></a>]兼容支持！</div><div>本资源包与FreshLX无关联，需搭配其资源包使用。</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>请至少使用[<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体纹理特征</a></strong> 7.0.1]与[<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体模型特征</a></strong> 3.0.1]模组。我计划覆盖Forge和Fabric平台模组，并尽量保留各模组的原始纹理映射方式，方便您继续使用自定义纹理。如有无法实现的情况将另行通知。本资源包应兼容EMF/ETF支持的所有Minecraft版本。OptiFine不支持模组实体，因此不兼容。</p><div>模组包作者可自由将此资源包加入您的整合包！（若加入请告知，我会将您列入下方列表😊）</div><hr><div><strong># </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23;text-decoration:underline\">兼容列表：</span></strong></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<div>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">守卫村民</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fguard-villagers-(fabricquilt)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>]与[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fguard-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 村民与史蒂夫模型均支持</div>\n<div>- 史蒂夫模型尚不支持1.6.x版本。</div>\n</div>\n</div><div><hr></div><div>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">好友与敌人</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffriends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>]与[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffriends-and-foes-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 哞花</div>\n<div>- 冰术师</div>\n<div>- 野火</div>\n<div>- 幻术师</div>\n</div><div><hr></div><div>\n<div>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">掠夺再续</span>&nbsp;[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fit-takes-a-pillage-continuation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric &amp; Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div>&gt; 仅对纹理进行了调整，需搭配Fresh Animations使用</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 弓箭手</div>\n<div>- 散兵</div>\n<div>- 军团兵</div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">霜冻世界</span>&nbsp;[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffrostiful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>]：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 寒冰掠夺者</div>\n<div>- 霜冻术士</div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<div>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">村民招募</span>[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n人类与普通模型均支持</div>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">村民职业拓展</span>[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n人类与普通模型均支持</div>\n<hr>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">更多生物变种</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-mob-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric &amp; Forge</a>]：</div><div>&gt; 仅对纹理进行了调整，需搭配Fresh Animations使用</div><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 猫</div>\n<div>- 牛</div>\n<div>- 猪</div>\n<div>- 羊</div>\n<div>- 狼</div>\n</div><div><hr>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">劫掠与卷心菜</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fravage-and-cabbage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 卷心菜人</div>\n<div>- 劫掠兽</div>\n</div><div><hr>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">野蛮与劫掠</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsavage-and-ravage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 爬行者</div>\n<div>- 刽子手</div>\n<div>- 破坏者</div>\n<div>- 欺诈师</div>\n<div>- 冰术师</div>\n<div>- 骷髅村民</div>\n</div><div><hr>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">宠物盔甲</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpet-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>]：</div><div>- 仅盔甲部分，狼本体需Fresh Animations支持</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>[<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fit-takes-a-pillage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠夺时代</a></span>] 遗憾的是<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">不兼容</span>！</div><div>---</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>您可通过[<a href=\"https://github.com/SebSemos/F.M.R.P-Freshly-Modded-/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>]随时建议添加新模组的兼容支持！</strong></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>（我不会添加与**原版风格不符**的疯狂Boss模组或其他内容）请建议至少更新到1.19.x或1.20.x版本的模组 :P</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><hr><strong># </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e67e23\"><strong>收录于：</strong></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>### <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">YouTube</span></div><div>- [<a href=\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=Ydgo5el2_gI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">2023年度TOP15 Minecraft纹理包（1.20+）</a>]</div><div>- [<a href=\"youtube.com/watch?v=dYtJ9ne9gZk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TOP20 自带Fresh Animations的Minecraft模组 第2期（全新与独特）</a>]</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>### <span style=\"color:#3598db\">整合包</span></div><div>- [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252felysium-days\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">极乐世界</a>]&nbsp;<br>- [<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/nxplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nXplored</a>]&nbsp;</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div><hr><strong>免责声明！</strong> 您可能会遇到一些bug，例如实体佩戴的头盔无法正确跟随头部，或某些攻击没有动画。部分问题可能源于我的资源包，也可能是EMF与模组交互方式导致的无法修复问题。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>如果您发现可修复的异常，请在[<a href=\"https://github.com/SebSemos/F.M.R.P-Freshly-Modded-/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>]提交问题！</p><p>🛠️ 已知问题：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Forge守卫等有多层纹理的实体存在Z-fighting（可能与此<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/issues/387\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题</a>相关）</li>\n<li>骷髅村民在切换姿态时手臂会短暂卡在头顶</li>\n<li>破坏者盔甲无法正确跟随手臂和身体</li>\n<li>破坏者、欺诈师和骷髅村民的LOD模型脸部存在多余纹理，虽已使用默认纹理，但LOD尚未激活</li>\n</ul>\n</div><hr><p>描述由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFyoncle\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fyoncle</a>提供！:)</p>",
